# Pasadizo (the underground passage, C3, contract 34), 6 x 34, interior. column = i, row = j. A long concrete corridor under the city of Cenit: big concrete slabs (3 variants), walls
# of small white tiles on the back sides, light posts, floor grates, a sign, a keeper who has seen it all and a Rich Salve on the way. The ladder at the north end (N) goes up to the north hut
# (Ruta 5), the one at the south end (U) to the south hut (Ruta 6). The open sides are black (solid void), like the user's mock.
@map pasadizo
@size 6 34
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill concrete
@spawn north 2 2 S              # arriving from the north hut
@spawn south 2 30 N             # arriving from the south hut
@legend
  .  tile=concrete                # 3 variants
  g  tile=grate
  W  tile=concrete object=twall
  J  tile=concrete object=twall
  v  tile=void_dark               # the dark beyond the open sides (solid)
  L  tile=concrete object=light_post
  N  tile=concrete door=rope_ladder
  U  tile=concrete door=rope_ladder
  p  tile=concrete object=sign interact=look text=pasadizo.sign
  i  tile=concrete item=rich_salve
  k  tile=concrete npc=guardia id=keeper face=SW text=pasadizo.keeper
@grid
  JJJJJJ
  W.N..v
  W....v
  W..p.v
  W....v
  W....v
  W...Lv
  W....v
  W....v
  W.gg.v
  W....v
  W....v
  W...Lv
  W....v
  W.g..v
  W....v
  Wi...v
  W....v
  W...Lv
  W..k.v
  W....v
  Wgg..v
  W....v
  W....v
  W...Lv
  W....v
  W....v
  W..g.v
  W....v
  W....v
  W...Lv
  W.U..v
  W....v
  vvvvvv
@warp N -> pasadizo_n spawn=ladder
@warp U -> pasadizo_s spawn=ladder
